Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(ui): pin each setup's own machine and post picks

Reproduced in the UI with two setups before any change: the Setup2
Machine and Post pages' own-mount radios, the Library and post pickers,
and the posted output (one file per mount, each through its own post)
all work on origin/main. This pins that behaviour; the failing path the
maintainer hit is not yet found, so the issue stays open.

Refs #1206

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
